          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwakusagamba kugapikanilape maloŵe ga Mlungu, nambo jwangatenda yigakuŵeceta maloŵego ali mpela mundu jwakusalilolela ngope jakwe pa ligalasi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nipo pitamalisye kujilola ngopejo, mwangakaŵa akusaliŵalila kuti ali jwamti uli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malamusi ga Mlungu gali gangali ulemwa nambo gakusampa mundu ufulu. Mundu jwakugapocela ni kugakuya malamusigo, ngaŵa jwagamba kugapikanape ni kugaliŵalila, jwele Mlungu tacimpa upile mu yitendo yakwe yosope.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
