              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naga jwine akulitenda kuti ali jwa dini mnope, nambo ali jwakuŵecetaga yangalumbana, dini jakwejo jili ja mtega, soni akusagamba kulilambusya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.26",
